msgstr "Øll"

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Also keep two tasks for each application in the task list: one to apply, which ticking sends to you as a suggestion, and one to hear back, which closes when the application ends. Reminders about an application sit under its open task."
msgstr "Halt eisini tvær uppgávur fyri hvørja umsókn í uppgávulistanum: eina at søkja, sum at krossa av sendir tær eitt uppskot, og eina at hoyra aftur, sum verður afturlatin, tá umsóknin endar. Áminningar um eina umsókn standa undir hennara opnu uppgávu."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Also write the whole days of the Calendar page (application deadlines, closing dates of listings and dates an offer must be answered by) to the calendar as all-day events, one way: a change made on the phone is written over. Needs the instance to know its own address."
msgstr "Skriva eisini heilu dagarnar á síðuni Kalendari (umsóknarfreistir, lokadagar á lýsingum og dagar, sum eitt tilboð skal svarast innan) í kalendaran sum heildagshendingar, í eina leið: ein broyting gjørd á telefonini verður yvirskrivað. Krevur, at uppsetingin kennir sín egna bústað."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
msgid "An app password where the server offers one. Stored encrypted."
msgstr "Eitt app-loyniorð, har ambætarin bjóðar eitt. Goymt bronglað."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
msgid "An interview changed on both sides at once; next run decides."
msgstr "Ein samrøða broyttist á báðum síðum í senn; næsta koyring avger."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
msgid "An interview deleted here had been changed on the phone since the last sync. The event was left on the calendar."
msgstr "Ein samrøða, sum varð strikað her, var broytt á telefonini síðan seinastu samstilling. Hendingin varð latin vera á kalendaranum."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
msgid "An interview moved to another address on the calendar; still paired."
msgstr "Ein samrøða flutti til eina aðra adressu á kalendaranum; framvegis parað."

#: src/postulo_dav/sync.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
